{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"92aff1971a43692aaac14ac7bbee7a56","RawContent":"If you do the complimentary package there is no deposit.  I did not have to pay MP a dime until 30 days before my wedding! :) \n \n Congrats to you! [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]KJRAZZLE[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi all, congrats to everyone! I&#039;m hoping to be a 2014 MP bride :) Does anyone know what the initial holding deposit is? I&#039;m signed up for the webinar, but it&#039;s not until April, and MP still hasn&#039;t responded to my email.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1732244,"PostDate":1363029982,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> If you do the complimentary package there is no deposit.\u00a0 I did not have to pay MP a dime until 30 days before my wedding! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Congrats to you!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>KJRAZZLE<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi all, congrats to everyone! I'm hoping to be a 2014 MP bride <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Does anyone know what the initial holding deposit is? I'm signed up for the webinar, but it's not until April, and MP still hasn't responded to my email.<\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shanna0487@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"63.122.89.3","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1294260274,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235127.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shan0487","Id":235127,"Name":"shan0487","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e9b37c67000409e23edf1fd0a4a3aca2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow! That&#039;s great news :) thanks so much!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1732435,"PostDate":1363052385,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wow! That's great news <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> thanks so much!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kjano99@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362843003,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267109.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KJRAZZLE","Id":267109,"Name":"KJRAZZLE","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"94b0e366f2fa4cdf1db955765e0c8884","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1732508,"PostDate":1363065403,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thank you!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"fbodyplaytoy1017@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362887700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267136.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":144,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JennyLynn824","Id":267136,"Name":"JennyLynn824","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2011d6f9c41e1488ee97de5c5289f125","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; You are welcome! Remember that I booked my wedding in Feb 2012- and Palace resorts are known for changing the rules when it comes to weddings- so if this policy has changed, I&#039;m sorry!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; If you ladies have any other palace related wedding questions or questions about the resort let me know! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1732555,"PostDate":1363096092,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> You are welcome! Remember that I booked my wedding in Feb 2012- and Palace resorts are known for changing the rules when it comes to weddings- so if this policy has changed, I'm sorry!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> If you ladies have any other palace related wedding questions or questions about the resort let me know! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shanna0487@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"63.122.89.3","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1294260274,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235127.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shan0487","Id":235127,"Name":"shan0487","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3f514bbcef57e0c6877e4137d8ebe363","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello Everyone ! I am looking into Moon Palace as well, April 27th, 2014. I was originally looking into NOW JADE, but I like Moon Place much better because of its size and there is much more to do. I also like the Colin Cowie wedding collections. I am having around 60 people so im wondering how much im lookin at for my wedding !!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1736374,"PostDate":1363809027,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello Everyone ! I am looking into Moon Palace as well, April 27th, 2014. I was originally looking into NOW JADE, but I like Moon Place much better because of its size and there is much more to do. I also like the Colin Cowie wedding collections. I am having around 60 people so im wondering how much im lookin at for my wedding !!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jinele84@netscape.net","IpAddress":"69.47.144.216","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362023223,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266681.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jinele Fracasso","Id":266681,"Name":"Jinele Fracasso","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a025f51824542e51a19bfd4a9322f536","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]superlawyer87[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I just got engaged on Thanksgiving 2012, and my fiance and I are working with a travel agent to plan a destination wedding on May 17, 2014. Anyone had an experience with Moon Palace, good or bad?? I&#039;m pretty sure this is the one we are going to go with.[\/quote] \n I have been to Moon Palace and I LOVED it. It&#039;s HUGE, so if thats what you like this is the perfect place. I am also looking into getiing married here. I originally choose Now Jade, but I like Moon Palace better, just waiting on some quotes since we will be having like 60 people in our wedding party !","Attachments":[],"Id":1736378,"PostDate":1363809128,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>superlawyer87<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I just got engaged on Thanksgiving 2012, and my fiance and I are working with a travel agent to plan a destination wedding on May 17, 2014. Anyone had an experience with Moon Palace, good or bad?? I'm pretty sure this is the one we are going to go with.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I have been to Moon Palace and I LOVED it. It's HUGE, so if thats what you like this is the perfect place. I am also looking into getiing married here. I originally choose Now Jade, but I like Moon Palace better, just waiting on some quotes since we will be having like 60 people in our wedding party !<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jinele84@netscape.net","IpAddress":"69.47.144.216","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362023223,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266681.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jinele Fracasso","Id":266681,"Name":"Jinele Fracasso","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"66eeff6c6407b801433cd3c29f394227","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Everyone!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;I recently booked my wedding at Moon Palace for April 26, 2014!! I was wondering if anyone has a list of the spa\/salon prices?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1743461,"PostDate":1365489074,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Everyone!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0 \u00a0I recently booked my wedding at Moon Palace for April 26, 2014!! I was wondering if anyone has a list of the spa\/salon prices?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kaliellis@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"208.99.156.92","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1360750848,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266018.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kaliellis10","Id":266018,"Name":"kaliellis10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"12e9d8de174fb9a7d8406a831b7925de","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]kaliellis10[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Everyone! \n \n    I recently booked my wedding at Moon Palace for April 26, 2014!! I was wondering if anyone has a list of the spa\/salon prices? \n \n Thanks![\/quote] \n I just booked my wedding at moon palace also April 27th! One day behind you we will be there the same time ~ Keep in touch for questions !","Attachments":[],"Id":1743707,"PostDate":1365547542,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>kaliellis10<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Everyone!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0 \u00a0I recently booked my wedding at Moon Palace for April 26, 2014!! I was wondering if anyone has a list of the spa\/salon prices?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I just booked my wedding at moon palace also April 27th! One day behind you we will be there the same time ~ Keep in touch for questions !\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jinele84@netscape.net","IpAddress":"69.47.144.216","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362023223,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266681.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jinele Fracasso","Id":266681,"Name":"Jinele Fracasso","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b888f558aeea6eb1c5205cde157e2c72","RawContent":"Hello ladies I&#039;m getting married on the 5th novembet 2014 at the moon palace. I can&#039;t wait \u00f0\u0178\u02dc\u20ac","Attachments":[],"Id":1744374,"PostDate":1365697114,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello ladies I'm getting married on the 5th novembet 2014 at the moon palace. I can't wait \u00f0\u0178\u02dc\u20ac\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bolderson2002@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1364491685,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267908.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kelly1979","Id":267908,"Name":"kelly1979","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"45e805228ebbc73bde7530cd2a9bbb62","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am getting married May 9th, 2014 at the Moon Palace. Has anyone looked into Hair\/makeup? I&#039;m hearing mixed reviews about the salons there. I wanted to hire an outside vendor for this by my TA is saying there is a $500 outside vendor fee. Ridiculous!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1747953,"PostDate":1366284517,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am getting married May 9th, 2014 at the Moon Palace. Has anyone looked into Hair\/makeup? I'm hearing mixed reviews about the salons there. I wanted to hire an outside vendor for this by my TA is saying there is a $500 outside vendor fee. Ridiculous!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gig783@aol.com","IpAddress":"65.199.191.168","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinD