Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f80c842192bfab36dba96db7469a793f","RawContent":"Hi All! I&#039;m looking to get married at Moon Palace next June! I&#039;m worried I&#039;ve waited too long to book now. I was just wondering how you went about your reservation. Did you call the wedding line? Do you have to book your stay first and then request a date\/time? We want our wedding to be earlier in the week of our stay, so if we don&#039;t get our first choice of dates can we change the reservation by a couple days? Thanks in advance, and Congrats to all!","Attachments":[],"Id":1750577,"PostDate":1366878433,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi All! I'm looking to get married at Moon Palace next June! I'm worried I've waited too long to book now. I was just wondering how you went about your reservation. Did you call the wedding line? Do you have to book your stay first and then request a date\/time? We want our wedding to be earlier in the week of our stay, so if we don't get our first choice of dates can we change the reservation by a couple days? Thanks in advance, and Congrats to all!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lm00956@georgiasouthern.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1364064056,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267701.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lm00956","Id":267701,"Name":"lm00956","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"31f10fabc7d6b64588c74834c291a5d3","RawContent":"Hi All! I&#039;m looking to get married at Moon Palace next June! I&#039;m worried I&#039;ve waited too long to book now. I was just wondering how you went about your reservation. Did you call the wedding line? Do you have to book your stay first and then request a date\/time? We want our wedding to be earlier in the week of our stay, so if we don&#039;t get our first choice of dates can we change the reservation by a couple days? Thanks in advance, and Congrats to all!","Attachments":[],"Id":1750578,"PostDate":1366878518,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi All! I'm looking to get married at Moon Palace next June! I'm worried I've waited too long to book now. I was just wondering how you went about your reservation. Did you call the wedding line? Do you have to book your stay first and then request a date\/time? We want our wedding to be earlier in the week of our stay, so if we don't get our first choice of dates can we change the reservation by a couple days? Thanks in advance, and Congrats to all!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lm00956@georgiasouthern.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1364064056,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267701.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lm00956","Id":267701,"Name":"lm00956","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53e33e41d660ace031c4f76aeabd7f4a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"lm00956\"]\nHi All! I&#039;m looking to get married at Moon Palace next June! I&#039;m worried I&#039;ve waited too long to book now. I was just wondering how you went about your reservation. Did you call the wedding line? Do you have to book your stay first and then request a date\/time? We want our wedding to be earlier in the week of our stay, so if we don&#039;t get our first choice of dates can we change the reservation by a couple days? Thanks in advance, and Congrats to all![\/quote] You have not waited too long.. I am getting married in June as well, and yes! A lot of dates are already booked up! First you select the date\/time and complete the actual wedding contract with moon palace. Then you will work on the dates you want to stay and book all of that through them or you can use a different travel agent. (But that comes after saving your date) Hope that helps! Message me if you have any other questions!","Attachments":[],"Id":1751117,"PostDate":1366993869,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"lm00956\" url=\"\/t\/83792\/moon&#045;palace&#045;2014\/30#post_1898647\"><p>Hi All! I'm looking to get married at Moon Palace next June! I'm worried I've waited too long to book now. I was just wondering how you went about your reservation. Did you call the wedding line? Do you have to book your stay first and then request a date\/time? We want our wedding to be earlier in the week of our stay, so if we don't get our first choice of dates can we change the reservation by a couple days? Thanks in advance, and Congrats to all!<\/p><\/blockquote> You have not waited too long.. I am getting married in June as well, and yes! A lot of dates are already booked up! First you select the date\/time and complete the actual wedding contract with moon palace. Then you will work on the dates you want to stay and book all of that through them or you can use a different travel agent. (But that comes after saving your date) Hope that helps! Message me if you have any other questions!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"juliedrew2014@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.123.8.194","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1366604745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268836.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Juliebeth","Id":268836,"Name":"Juliebeth","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca4ab6007c829dbb2262c425d8a1acec","RawContent":"My TA secured my date for me- I did not go directly through Palace resorts to book my wedding date, so I think either way works! :) [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Juliebeth[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n You have not waited too long.. I am getting married in June as well, and yes! A lot of dates are already booked up!\n First you select the date\/time and complete the actual wedding contract with moon palace. Then you will work on the dates you want to stay and book all of that through them or you can use a different travel agent. (But that comes after saving your date)\n Hope that helps! Message me if you have any other questions![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1751122,"PostDate":1366995261,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My TA secured my date for me- I did not go directly through Palace resorts to book my wedding date, so I think either way works! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Juliebeth<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> You have not waited too long.. I am getting married in June as well, and yes! A lot of dates are already booked up!<br \/> First you select the date\/time and complete the actual wedding contract with moon palace. Then you will work on the dates you want to stay and book all of that through them or you can use a different travel agent. (But that comes after saving your date)<br \/> Hope that helps! Message me if you have any other questions!<\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shanna0487@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"63.122.89.3","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1294260274,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235127.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shan0487","Id":235127,"Name":"shan0487","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"117ee7b665d4a534e535fa63dc03bac5","RawContent":"[quote name=\"shan0487\"]\nMy TA secured my date for me- I did not go directly through Palace resorts to book my wedding date, so I think either way works! :)[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1751297,"PostDate":1367028110,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"shan0487\" url=\"\/t\/83792\/moon&#045;palace&#045;2014\/30#post_1899191\"><p>My TA secured my date for me- I did not go directly through Palace resorts to book my wedding date, so I think either way works! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"juliedrew2014@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.123.8.194","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1366604745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268836.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Juliebeth","Id":268836,"Name":"Juliebeth","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22bd2d74173e81578ee7c2597e1fc0fc","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Juliebeth\"][\/quote][quote name=\"shan0487\"]\nMy TA secured my date for me- I did not go directly through Palace resorts to book my wedding date, so I think either way works! :)[\/quote] Oh, that is good to know! What is your wedding date?!","Attachments":[],"Id":1751301,"PostDate":1367028213,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"Juliebeth\" url=\"\/t\/83792\/moon&#045;palace&#045;2014\/30#post_1899366\"><p><\/p><\/blockquote><blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"shan0487\" url=\"\/t\/83792\/moon&#045;palace&#045;2014\/30#post_1899191\"><p>My TA secured my date for me- I did not go directly through Palace resorts to book my wedding date, so I think either way works! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/blockquote> Oh, that is good to know! What is your wedding date?!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"juliedrew2014@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.123.8.194","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1366604745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268836.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Juliebeth","Id":268836,"Name":"Juliebeth","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2c458ba38f83be13b10477ce398c0df9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; If you have a date in mind you can request your date in this link is very easy http:\/\/www.palaceresorts.com\/weddings\/wedding-rfp-en.html&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; hope this help you!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1751531,"PostDate":1367118062,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> If you have a date in mind you can request your date in this link is very easy <a href='http:\/\/www.palaceresorts.com\/weddings\/wedding-rfp-en.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.palaceres...ing-rfp-en.html<\/a><\/p> <p> hope this help you!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ana.espipadi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1367116535,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269044.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ana26","Id":269044,"Name":"ana26","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"81594a41573c9ae431385a2b87e67bf4","RawContent":"I am already married! :)  I got married November 23rd 2012.  So if you have any questions feel free to PM me! :) [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Juliebeth[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n Oh, that is good to know! What is your wedding date?![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1751922,"PostDate":1367244196,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am already married! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 I got married November 23rd 2012.\u00a0 So if you have any questions feel free to PM me! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Juliebeth<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Oh, that is good to know! What is your wedding date?!<\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shanna0487@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"63.122.89.3","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1294260274,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235127.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shan0487","Id":235127,"Name":"shan0487","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0ea2623717db8e465346b9514bc999ac","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Juliebeth\"]\nYou have not waited too long.. I am getting married in June as well, and yes! A lot of dates are already booked up! First you select the date\/time and complete the actual wedding contract with moon palace. Then you will work on the dates you want to stay and book all of that through them or you can use a different travel agent. (But that comes after saving your date) Hope that helps! Message me if you have any other questions![\/quote] Thanks so much!","Attachments":[],"Id":1752115,"PostDate":1367263413,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"Juliebeth\" url=\"\/t\/83792\/moon&#045;palace&#045;2014\/30#post_1899186\"><p>You have not waited too long.. I am getting married in June as well, and yes! A lot of dates are already booked up! First you select the date\/time and complete the actual wedding contract with moon palace. Then you will work on the dates you want to stay and book all of that through them or you can use a different travel agent. (But that comes after saving your date) Hope that helps! Message me if you have any other questions!<\/p><\/blockquote> Thanks so much!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lm00956@georgiasouthern.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1364064056,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267701.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lm00956","Id":267701,"Name":"lm00956","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"41aee5014074b3af2b378ffe327add2d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am planning on using an IPOD for my ceromony and reception.. Does anyone have any recommendations for music to add or those brides who already had their wedding, Is there any reccomendations or playlists you feel like sharing?! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1752699,"PostDate":1367359933,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\