l receive or if you have been confirmed to get the ones that Moon Palace already offers? Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1755296,"PostDate":1367946434,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello, My travel agent just informed me that we may not get the perks (unlimited private functions etc) because they are offered for 2013 and my wedding is in 2014. I was wondering if anyone has been told what perks they will receive or if you have been confirmed to get the ones that Moon Palace already offers? Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kaliellis@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"208.99.156.92","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1360750848,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266018.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kaliellis10","Id":266018,"Name":"kaliellis10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5308f3639ed01576d895a0cc9bfa1d20","RawContent":"Hi kaliellis10, I&#039;m actually going over the group room block right now and all the perks of unlimited events, complimentary nights etc are all written in there. They are offering the same perks for 2014 as they do for 2013. My travel agent has been doing a great job in getting every question I have answered. [quote name=\"kaliellis10\"]\nHello, My travel agent just informed me that we may not get the perks (unlimited private functions etc) because they are offered for 2013 and my wedding is in 2014. I was wondering if anyone has been told what perks they will receive or if you have been confirmed to get the ones that Moon Palace already offers? Thanks![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1755404,"PostDate":1367964271,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi kaliellis10, I'm actually going over the group room block right now and all the perks of unlimited events, complimentary nights etc are all written in there. They are offering the same perks for 2014 as they do for 2013. My travel agent has been doing a great job in getting every question I have answered. <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"kaliellis10\" url=\"\/t\/83792\/moon&#045;palace&#045;2014\/30#post_1903365\"><p>Hello, My travel agent just informed me that we may not get the perks (unlimited private functions etc) because they are offered for 2013 and my wedding is in 2014. I was wondering if anyone has been told what perks they will receive or if you have been confirmed to get the ones that Moon Palace already offers? Thanks!<\/p><\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vloeza@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.47.137.164","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1341182021,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257337.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Vivi224","Id":257337,"Name":"Vivi224","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8edfaa45d2fb231af277dc613a9b0886","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Vivi224[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Hi kaliellis10,\n I&#039;m actually going over the group room block right now and all the perks of unlimited events, complimentary nights etc are all written in there. They are offering the same perks for 2014 as they do for 2013. My travel agent has been doing a great job in getting every question I have answered.[\/quote] \n I agree! My agent was able to \"grandfather\" the 2013 perks, like the resort credits and kids stay free (which is only offered during summer months, I believe)! Double check your contract and it should all be spelled out there as well!","Attachments":[],"Id":1755692,"PostDate":1368032377,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Vivi224<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Hi kaliellis10,<br \/> I'm actually going over the group room block right now and all the perks of unlimited events, complimentary nights etc are all written in there. They are offering the same perks for 2014 as they do for 2013. My travel agent has been doing a great job in getting every question I have answered.<\/blockquote> <p> I agree! My agent was able to \"grandfather\" the 2013 perks, like the resort credits and kids stay free (which is only offered during summer months, I believe)! Double check your contract and it should all be spelled out there as well!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenvens7@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.227.210.51","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1358454948,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264628.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":211,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jenvens7","Id":264628,"Name":"jenvens7","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"104dcb9a62ba9137f5c6bae0ea7e1611","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello! I was just engaged on April 12th, and we are in the beginning phases of planning a destination wedding. For those of you having your wedding at Moon Palace, what made you choose it over other resorts? It is in my top 5 right now, and I&#039;m searching for certain aspects of my top choices to narrow it down to \"the one\"! Thanks! xoxo&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1755724,"PostDate":1368034375,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello! I was just engaged on April 12th, and we are in the beginning phases of planning a destination wedding. For those of you having your wedding at Moon Palace, what made you choose it over other resorts? It is in my top 5 right now, and I'm searching for certain aspects of my top choices to narrow it down to \"the one\"! Thanks! xoxo<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"breynolds87@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1367376497,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269177.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Futurefiler87","Id":269177,"Name":"Futurefiler87","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"75a1fb4cf83934b9976e6c3c9adff814","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Futurefiler87\"]\nHello! I was just engaged on April 12th, and we are in the beginning phases of planning a destination wedding. For those of you having your wedding at Moon Palace, what made you choose it over other resorts? It is in my top 5 right now, and I&#039;m searching for certain aspects of my top choices to narrow it down to \"the one\"! Thanks! xoxo[\/quote]Congrats! I was engaged April 6th :) don&#039;t know how u have made a top 5 lol I was so lost when I began! Knew nothing about resorts etc, good for you for having a top 5!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1755734,"PostDate":1368035200,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"Futurefiler87\" url=\"\/t\/83792\/moon&#045;palace&#045;2014\/30#post_1903793\"><p>Hello! I was just engaged on April 12th, and we are in the beginning phases of planning a destination wedding. For those of you having your wedding at Moon Palace, what made you choose it over other resorts? It is in my top 5 right now, and I'm searching for certain aspects of my top choices to narrow it down to \"the one\"! Thanks! xoxo<\/p><\/blockquote>Congrats! I was engaged April 6th <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> don't know how u have made a top 5 lol I was so lost when I began! Knew nothing about resorts etc, good for you for having a top 5!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kpoirier@ualberta.ca","IpAddress":"142.179.209.110","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1365642436,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268428.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsShoreytobe","Id":268428,"Name":"MrsShoreytobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"de644327a1f0d507624977e767963306","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; lol I feel like I add and remove resorts from that list every day! Are you getting married at Moon Palace? If so, what made you choose it?\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1755739,"PostDate":1368035362,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> lol I feel like I add and remove resorts from that list every day! Are you getting married at Moon Palace? If so, what made you choose it?<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"breynolds87@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1367376497,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269177.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Futurefiler87","Id":269177,"Name":"Futurefiler87","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"85deb6243d5d0c251d59b30ed65d228b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats all your newly engaged fiancees!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The Moon Palace makes a gorgeous wedding venue......as seen in these magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc recorded at some of his weddings there, shown here.....&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1368047383973_1083\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"202423\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/202423\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1368047383973_1458\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"202424\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/202424\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1368047383973_1812\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"202425\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/202425\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1368047383973_2166\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"202426\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/202426\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1368047383973_2518\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"202427\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/202427\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1368047383973_2875\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"202428\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/202428\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Wishing everyone happy research + planning, and that your wedding is the Perfect Big Day you envision!!! Cheers :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; team MTM asst, Lynda :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1755813,"PostDate":1368044639,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats all your newly engaged fiancees!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The Moon Palace makes a gorgeous wedding venue......as seen in these magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc recorded at some of his weddings there, shown here.....<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1368047383973_1083\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"202423\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/202423\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1368047383973_1458\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"202424\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/202424\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1368047383973_1812\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"202425\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/202425\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1368047383973_2166\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"202426\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/202426\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1368047383973_2518\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"202427\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/202427\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1368047383973_2875\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"202428\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/202428\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Wishing everyone happy research + planning, and that your wedding is the Perfect Big Day you envision!!! Cheers <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> team MTM asst, Lynda <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1009,"TotalPages":101,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":1000},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
