{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":41177,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"698a30c0f3c43054968656cea2a3a67f","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;angelalanahung&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi,\n \n I also booked with VH. I haven&#039;t heard much from them apart from receiving a pack with forms that I need to fill in asking what colours we would like etc...\n \n We went for the deluxe wedding package, we get the sapphire collection but VH said that all we need to do is request a different collection and that shouldn&#039;t be a problem. I didn&#039;t like the sea shells that they include in that package. I always think they look a little tacky :~&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;When are you getting married as I&#039;ve had no info\/ forms from Virgin at all, do you think I should contact them? its about 9 months til ours, maybe they will send it closer to the time? I looked at the package information the Moon Palace sent me .. Did you get the package info from Virgin or from Moon palace. I dont remember seeing anything about seashells but from other posts on here they dont seen to be going down too well!!\n \n thanks for your help :)","Attachments":[],"Id":808270,"PostDate":1250776744,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>angelalanahung<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi,<br \/> <br \/> I also booked with VH. I haven't heard much from them apart from receiving a pack with forms that I need to fill in asking what colours we would like etc...<br \/> <br \/> We went for the deluxe wedding package, we get the sapphire collection but VH said that all we need to do is request a different collection and that shouldn't be a problem. I didn't like the sea shells that they include in that package. I always think they look a little tacky :~<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>When are you getting married as I've had no info\/ forms from Virgin at all, do you think I should contact them? its about 9 months til ours, maybe they will send it closer to the time? I looked at the package information the Moon Palace sent me .. Did you get the package info from Virgin or from Moon palace. I dont remember seeing anything about seashells but from other posts on here they dont seen to be going down too well!!<br \/> <br \/> thanks for your help <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;3\/st\/20100603\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/5\/k\/3143\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...3143\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"clare.brewer@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1248283642,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219696.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cb280182","Id":219696,"Name":"cb280182","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":41177,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0263cff566e512b36c632ec07c215d1b","RawContent":"I looked at the collections and I &lt;strong&gt;LOVE &lt;\/strong&gt;the sapphire collection! how can seashells be tacky if you are getting married on a beach? lol! that is the whole purpose of getting married at MP- ocean, beach, tropics... then the seashells fit right in with the theme, and you don&#039;t even have to pay extra! \n \n My FI likes the amber but I think that I am going to pull a bridezilla and overrule him b\/c my bridesmaid dresses are going to be a similar shade of blue. The amber is nice but the shells are making me lean towards the sapphire. I have attached the file with the pictures of each collection, compliments of Rachel :-) does anyone have pictures of the bouquets for each collection?&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;6470&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;WEDDING COLLECTIONS SET UP.pdf&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:1322.1748046875,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;pdf&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":808493,"PostDate":1250794227,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I looked at the collections and I <strong>LOVE <\/strong>the sapphire collection! how can seashells be tacky if you are getting married on a beach? lol! that is the whole purpose of getting married at MP- ocean, beach, tropics... then the seashells fit right in with the theme, and you don't even have to pay extra! <br \/> <br \/> My FI likes the amber but I think that I am going to pull a bridezilla and overrule him b\/c my bridesmaid dresses are going to be a similar shade of blue. The amber is nice but the shells are making me lean towards the sapphire. I have attached the file with the pictures of each collection, compliments of Rachel :-) does anyone have pictures of the bouquets for each collection?<p>\u00a0<\/p><span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"6470\",\"name\":\"WEDDING COLLECTIONS SET UP.pdf\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":1322.1748046875,\"type\":\"pdf\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bowlofcherries28@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"74.108.20.94","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1226771822,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212683.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":154,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"slapsappyhappy","Id":212683,"Name":"slapsappyhappy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":41177,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"216a666f583e3814eac2b811c71412b0","RawContent":"I looked at the collections and I &lt;strong&gt;LOVE &lt;\/strong&gt;the sapphire collection! how can seashells be tacky if you are getting married on a beach? lol! that is the whole purpose of getting married at MP- ocean, beach, tropics... then the seashells fit right in with the theme, and you don&#039;t even have to pay extra! \n \n My FI likes the amber but I think that I am going to pull a bridezilla and overrule him b\/c my bridesmaid dresses are going to be a similar shade of blue. The amber is nice but the shells are making me lean towards the sapphire. I have attached the file with the pictures of each collection, compliments of Rachel :-) does anyone have pictures of the bouquets for each collection?","Attachments":[],"Id":808497,"PostDate":1250794578,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I looked at the collections and I <strong>LOVE <\/strong>the sapphire collection! how can seashells be tacky if you are getting married on a beach? lol! that is the whole purpose of getting married at MP- ocean, beach, tropics... then the seashells fit right in with the theme, and you don't even have to pay extra! <br \/> <br \/> My FI likes the amber but I think that I am going to pull a bridezilla and overrule him b\/c my bridesmaid dresses are going to be a similar shade of blue. The amber is nice but the shells are making me lean towards the sapphire. I have attached the file with the pictures of each collection, compliments of Rachel :-) does anyone have pictures of the bouquets for each collection?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bowlofcherries28@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"74.108.20.94","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1226771822,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212683.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":154,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"slapsappyhappy","Id":212683,"Name":"slapsappyhappy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":41177,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b78d9cd530862f00b700e3609f8396c2","RawContent":"Gutted, I dont have enough posts to open the package pdf!!","Attachments":[],"Id":808617,"PostDate":1250803080,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Gutted, I dont have enough posts to open the package pdf!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;3\/st\/20100603\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/5\/k\/3143\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...3143\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"clare.brewer@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1248283642,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219696.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cb280182","Id":219696,"Name":"cb280182","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":41177,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6cac6b847050cfb3efe5ce2ccab02d23","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;cb280182&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;When are you getting married as I&#039;ve had no info\/ forms from Virgin at all, do you think I should contact them? its about 9 months til ours, maybe they will send it closer to the time? I looked at the package information the Moon Palace sent me .. Did you get the package info from Virgin or from Moon palace. I dont remember seeing anything about seashells but from other posts on here they dont seen to be going down too well!!\n \n thanks for your help :)&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Hi!\n \n I am getting married on May 17th 2010. VH sent me my package a couple of weeks after I booked mine. You should have received something by now so I would give them a call and chase it up.\n \n So what have people said about the seashells? I haven&#039;t heard anything, just not for me :)","Attachments":[],"Id":809132,"PostDate":1250821139,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>cb280182<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">When are you getting married as I've had no info\/ forms from Virgin at all, do you think I should contact them? its about 9 months til ours, maybe they will send it closer to the time? I looked at the package information the Moon Palace sent me .. Did you get the package info from Virgin or from Moon palace. I dont remember seeing anything about seashells but from other posts on here they dont seen to be going down too well!!<br \/> <br \/> thanks for your help <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Hi!<br \/> <br \/> I am getting married on May 17th 2010. VH sent me my package a couple of weeks after I booked mine. You should have received something by now so I would give them a call and chase it up.<br \/> <br \/> So what have people said about the seashells? I haven't heard anything, just not for me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/Z1a8p1.png\">http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/Z1a8p1.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"actl.1980@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1250514946,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220624.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":213,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"angelalanahung","Id":220624,"Name":"angelalanahung","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":41177,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c34c1dba8d88c8c3baf55d07016b4657","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;cb280182&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Gutted, I dont have enough posts to open the package pdf!!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I can email you these if you would like? :)","Attachments":[],"Id":809134,"PostDate":1250821225,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>cb280182<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Gutted, I dont have enough posts to open the package pdf!!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I can email you these if you would like? <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/Z1a8p1.png\">http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/Z1a8p1.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"actl.1980@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1250514946,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220624.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":213,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"angelalanahung","Id":220624,"Name":"angelalanahung","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":41177,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4e02badc92c5dd434d6e8228a8166810","RawContent":"slapsappyhappy - Would you mind emailing the collections set up. While I am not looking at the MP, I am looking at the Playacar Palace and everything is very similar across the palace resorts board. I have some points but it is telling me that I do not have the permission to view it. my email is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:tanya_armenti@yahoo.com\"&gt;tanya_armenti@yahoo.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n Thank you Much!\n ~Tanya","Attachments":[],"Id":809513,"PostDate":1250845552,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                slapsappyhappy - Would you mind emailing the collections set up. While I am not looking at the MP, I am looking at the Playacar Palace and everything is very similar across the palace resorts board. I have some points but it is telling me that I do not have the permission to view it. my email is <a href='mailto:tanya_armenti@yahoo.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>tanya_armenti@yahoo.com<\/a><br \/> Thank you Much!<br \/> ~Tanya\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Happily Married after an AMAZING wedding at the Playaca Palace in Playa del Carmen, MX!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tanya_armenti@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"100.8.142.57","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1238950375,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216479.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tanya Marie","Id":216479,"Name":"Tanya Marie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":41177,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b1aad62a3ca40ee4bc92715980bf5a6c","RawContent":"Thanks ever so much, that would be great! my email is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:cb280182@hotmail.com\"&gt;cb280182@hotmail.com&lt;\/a&gt;.","Attachments":[],"Id":809555,"PostDate":1250857662,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks ever so much, that would be great! my email is <a href='mailto:cb280182@hotmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>cb280182@hotmail.com<\/a>.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;3\/st\/20100603\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/5\/k\/3143\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...3143\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"clare.brewer@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1248283642,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219696.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cb280182","Id":219696,"Name":"cb280182","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":41177,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"740f13520ebe5dbd48173a256d7a7b31","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;angelalanahung&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi!\n \n I am getting married on May 17th 2010. VH sent me my package a couple of weeks after I booked mine. You should have received something by now so I would give them a call and chase it up.\n \n So what have people said about the seashells? I haven&#039;t heard anything, just not for me :)&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Oh now I am getting worried, we booked our wedding through a little independant travel agent in April (2 days before the swine flu breakout, you can imagine all the comments we got when we told people where we were going!) I have virgins contact details so I going to give them a quick email today and maybe pop into the travel agents saturday. Has anyone decided which gazebo you would like? Think we are going for the Immaculate conception ( H2B is catholic) but no ideas evening events as yet. Thanks for your help","Attachments":[],"Id":809556,"PostDate":1250857964,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>angelalanahung<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi!<br \/> <br \/> I am getting married on May 17th 2010. VH sent me my package a couple of weeks after I booked mine. You should have received something by now so I would give them a call and chase it up.<br \/> <br \/> So what have people said about the seashells? I haven't heard anything, just not for me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Oh now I am getting worried, we booked our wedding through a little independant travel agent in April (2 days before the swine flu breakout, you can imagine all the comments we got when we told people where we were going!) I have virgins contact details so I going to give them a quick email today and maybe pop into the travel agents saturday. Has anyone decided which gazebo you would like? Think we are going for the Immaculate conception ( H2B is catholic) but no ideas evening events as yet. Thanks for your help\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;3\/st\/20100603\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/5\/k\/3143\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...3143\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"clare.brewer@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1248283642,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219696.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cb280182","Id":219696,"Name":"cb280182","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":41177,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f07f5e706f006ef8ffeecd1c0feef0a4","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;cb280182&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Thanks ever so much, that would be great! my email is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:cb280182@hotmail.com\"&gt;cb280182@hotmail.com&lt;\/a&gt;.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;All sent! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":809559,"PostDate":1250858837,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n       