Id":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1423105061,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.png?_r=1423373502","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":138,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashhtayy","Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.115.43","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79425,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e809a6897d9026c3a93ab620956fae10","RawContent":"Haha I got nice bitch (Taurus). People always say I say the meanest things in the nicest ways possible!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1901530,"PostDate":1438208513,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Haha I got nice bitch (Taurus). People always say I say the meanest things in the nicest ways possible!! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Excellence Riviera Cancun - 12.12.15 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79332-tnt2015s-planning-thread-excellence-riviera-cancun-121215\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a>","Email":"tricey517@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.103.119.195","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422850763,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281976.jpg?_r=1423183212","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TNT2015","Id":281976,"Name":"TNT2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79425,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c3f5b168bc804937dd6697644f8e9271","RawContent":"@[member=\"deecol\"] thank you so much for the kind words \u263a\ufe0f I love that you took the casual route to asking your bridal entourage while your fianc\u00e9 went the elaborate way. You guys are cute. To tell you the truth, I saw a whole bunch of bridal \"proposals\" to their bridesmaids on Instagram and that&#039;s how I got inspired. I asked Derrick if he&#039;d like me to order a label for his best man. He looked at me, picked up his phone and texted his best man. Then said, all done. Lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1901535,"PostDate":1438212214,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281751\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281751-deecol\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">deecol<\/span><\/a> thank you so much for the kind words \u263a\ufe0f I love that you took the casual route to asking your bridal entourage while your fianc\u00e9 went the elaborate way. You guys are cute. To tell you the truth, I saw a whole bunch of bridal \"proposals\" to their bridesmaids on Instagram and that's how I got inspired. I asked Derrick if he'd like me to order a label for his best man. He looked at me, picked up his phone and texted his best man. Then said, all done. Lol \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410098585,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1431039162","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79425,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1438259251,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f3541053d98b279a0ebabf8ceab2340","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Wafflesmom\"] haha Derrick sounds like Colin! &amp;nbsp;Both of ours were super casual, he went the text message route as well, his best man and groomsman are in the UK, he also would never put that much effort into it because he would think the guys would make fun of him lol&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It was actually my best friend&#039;s fianc\u00e9 who went all elaborate, she couldn&#039;t believe it lol. &amp;nbsp;She thinks he looked at her Pinterest account when she left her iPad out lol&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;One of the items he put in the box. &amp;nbsp;How cute is this? &amp;nbsp;I think she had to of helped a bit!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/blu182.mail.live.com\/att\/GetAttachment.aspx?tnail=0&amp;amp;messageId=2ae62319-36b6-11e5-8f87-00215ad6e7d4&amp;amp;Aux=114%7C0%7C8D298DA12628440%7C%7C0%7C0%7C0%7C0%7C%7C%7C10%7Cdeannaproteau%40hotmail.com&amp;amp;cid=3708a65737bcdc1f&amp;amp;maxwidth=220&amp;amp;maxheight=160&amp;amp;size=Att&amp;amp;blob=MHxJTUdfNzE3OS5qcGVnfGltYWdlL2pwZWc_3d\" alt=\"GetAttachment.aspx?tnail=0&amp;amp;messageId=2ae\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901558,"PostDate":1438259226,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279721\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279721-wafflesmom\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Wafflesmom<\/span><\/a> haha Derrick sounds like Colin! \u00a0Both of ours were super casual, he went the text message route as well, his best man and groomsman are in the UK, he also would never put that much effort into it because he would think the guys would make fun of him lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It was actually my best friend's fianc\u00e9 who went all elaborate, she couldn't believe it lol. \u00a0She thinks he looked at her Pinterest account when she left her iPad out lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>One of the items he put in the box. \u00a0How cute is this? \u00a0I think she had to of helped a bit!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/blu182.mail.live.com\/att\/GetAttachment.aspx?tnail=0&messageId=2ae62319-36b6-11e5-8f87-00215ad6e7d4&Aux=114%7C0%7C8D298DA12628440%7C%7C0%7C0%7C0%7C0%7C%7C%7C10%7Cdeannaproteau%40hotmail.com&cid=3708a65737bcdc1f&maxwidth=220&maxheight=160&size=Att&blob=MHxJTUdfNzE3OS5qcGVnfGltYWdlL2pwZWc_3d\" alt=\"GetAttachment.aspx?tnail=0&messageId=2ae\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1421442569,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1439851759","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.39.127","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79425,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"589203fe7fa5ef39df3b434323f6cdcf","RawContent":"@[member=\"deecol\"] oops, sorry I totally misread your post. I thought Colin had prepared the groomsman box! Lol Ok so Derrick and Colin sound too alike ;) Derrick knew his best man would definitely make fun of him if he did anything like that. I couldn&#039;t see the attachment though.","Attachments":[],"Id":1901566,"PostDate":1438265039,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n               