g for a family friendly&amp;nbsp; resort in either Jamaica or Cancun.   I have researched Palace Resorts, Hard Rock resorts,&amp;nbsp; Dreams Resorts and&amp;nbsp; Karisma Resort. I am not to keen on breezes\/sandal resorts.I would like to be about to have&amp;nbsp; a non commercialized wedding. Sandals seems really standard. If anyone could help or has been recently or getting married and has a review.&amp;nbsp; Please message in my thread.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks Monica&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1750609,"PostDate":1366894600,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0Hello Everyone,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am currently looking for a family friendly\u00a0 resort in either Jamaica or Cancun.\u00a0\u00a0 I have researched Palace Resorts, Hard Rock resorts,\u00a0 Dreams Resorts and\u00a0 Karisma Resort. I am not to keen on breezes\/sandal resorts.I would like to be about to have\u00a0 a non commercialized wedding. Sandals seems really standard. If anyone could help or has been recently or getting married and has a review.\u00a0 Please message in my thread.<\/p> <p> Thanks Monica<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"monneeluvv@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1339117996,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256383.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Monica Mike","Id":256383,"Name":"Monica Mike","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"Sh