e":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73727,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bb39afbee8eba76f00a3cf813d5dc11a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats ladies on an early start,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am sure you will get helpful information on the forum, dont hesitate to ask for advice and we will be happy to help!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Happy Planning&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Joyce!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1780330,"PostDate":1374210445,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats ladies on an early start,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am sure you will get helpful information on the forum, dont hesitate to ask for advice and we will be happy to help!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Happy Planning\u00a0<\/p> <p> Joyce!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html'>http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1326854387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73727,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c33d47e4e9186f024e80271a139887fc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;I am also getting married 2015 very excited my h2b really wants mexico but we are so unsure on which resort.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;we keep changing our mind lol&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;happy searching x x&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1802373,"PostDate":1380016465,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>I am also getting married 2015 very excited my h2b really wants mexico but we are so unsure on which resort.<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>we keep changing our mind lol<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>happy searching x x<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pennyltaylor186@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"77.98.22.59","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1356791999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263605.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sky186","Id":263605,"Name":"sky186","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73727,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d0118f34826284f186fc4a80ec0c6f79","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats Monica, Kaiden + sky!!! yes, it&#039;s an exciting time to select your wedding venue! especially with so many great ones to choose from......on the other hand, you can hardly go wrong, as they&#039;re all so beautiful :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Wishing everyone happy research, and all the best with their plans - Enjoy the journey :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"221731\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/221731\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"221732\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/221732\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"221733\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/221733\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"221734\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/221734\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"221735\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/221735\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1802448,"PostDate":1380045770,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats Monica, Kaiden + sky!!! yes, it's an exciting time to select your wedding venue! especially with so many great ones to choose from......on the other hand, you can hardly go wrong, as they're all so beautiful <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Wishing everyone happy research, and all the best with their plans - Enjoy the journey <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"221731\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/221731\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"221732\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/221732\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"221733\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/221733\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"221734\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/221734\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"221735\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/221735\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73727,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d5610f13f5a89e51f730114129514ac8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi lades! I&#039;m a 2015 Bride in the same boat as you gals! &lt;a contenteditable=\"false\" data-huddler-embed=\"href\" href=\"\/u\/57727\/Monica-Mike\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"&gt;@Monica Mike&lt;\/a&gt; it looks like we&#039;re interested in some of the same resorts! None of the websites really knocked me off my feet, so I am thinking about doing a site visit. How about you?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1811891,"PostDate":1383623789,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi lades! I'm a 2015 Bride in the same boat as you gals! <a href='\/u\/57727\/Monica-Mike' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>@Monica Mike<\/a> it looks like we're interested in some of the same resorts! None of the websites really knocked me off my feet, so I am thinking about doing a site visit. How about you?\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Those who matter don't mind. Those who mind don't matter. -Dr. Seuss<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"babystace1985@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1379618714,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273612.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"babystace1985","Id":273612,"Name":"babystace1985","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73727,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7b48d15f2c4791253200187034fa0cc8","RawContent":"Yay excited to see other 2015 brides! My top pick as of right now is Now Jade. They just offer so many good locations and the packages are right on. I am planning on doing a site visit next summer to confirm my resort","Attachments":[],"Id":1811970,"PostDate":1383672357,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yay excited to see other 2015 brides! My top pick as of right now is Now Jade. They just offer so many good locations and the packages are right on. I am planning on doing a site visit next summer to confirm my resort\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"garcia2995@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"50.77.138.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1380584822,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273907.jpg?_r=1402680891","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Raquelita0715","Id":273907,"Name":"Raquelita0715","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.61.104.237","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73727,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"96165520c10726bd2eed43e1bb7ac988","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi everyone! I&#039;m also super excited to see other 2015 brides...I was feeling a little crazy for starting planning so far in advance, but I figure for a destination wedding people need to plan really far in advance.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I just booked my ceremony at the Now Jade for June 17, 2015. &amp;nbsp;My fianc\u00e9 and I visited last year and LOVED it. &amp;nbsp;It&#039;s a great balance between intimate and spacious, and they reeeally seem to know their wedding stuff. &amp;nbsp;My parents also stayed there earlier in the year and loved it. &amp;nbsp;I think it would be a great choice!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1823482,"PostDate":1389054100,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everyone! I'm also super excited to see other 2015 brides...I was feeling a little crazy for starting planning so far in advance, but I figure for a destination wedding people need to plan really far in advance.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I just booked my ceremony at the Now Jade for June 17, 2015. \u00a0My fianc\u00e9 and I visited last year and LOVED it. \u00a0It's a great balance between intimate and spacious, and they reeeally seem to know their wedding stuff. \u00a0My parents also stayed there earlier in the year and loved it. \u00a0I think it would be a great choice!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rachelia160@aim.com","IpAddress":"66.61.104.237","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388731897,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275855.jpg?_r=1435853657","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rachelia160","Id":275855,"Name":"rachelia160","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.197.53.90","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73727,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"503f1acf58f0fc34c08ca4ae04de7ad2","RawContent":"[quote name=\"rachelia160\" post=\"1823482\" timestamp=\"1389054100\"]\nHi everyone! I&#039;m also super excited to see other 2015 brides...I was feeling a little crazy for starting planning so far in advance, but I figure for a destination wedding people need to plan really far in advance.\n\nI just booked my ceremony at the Now Jade for June 17, 2015.  My fianc\u00e9 and I visited last year and LOVED it.  It&#039;s a great balance between intimate and spacious, and they reeeally seem to know their wedding stuff.  My parents also stayed there earlier in the year and loved it.  I think it would be a great choice![\/quote]\nAre you having a legal ceremony there or the symbolic. I looked in to the legal requirements and it seems like they require a lot of information. My understanding is that a lot of brides get married at a Justice of the Peace before heading to Mexico for the ceremony... am I curious how you are proceeding.\n\nThanks.","Attachments":[],"Id":1824038,"PostDate":1389192342,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>rachelia160, on 06 January 2014 - 04:21 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi everyone! I'm also super excited to see other 2015 brides...I was feeling a little crazy for starting planning so far in advance, but I figure for a destination wedding people need to plan really far in advance.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I just booked my ceremony at the Now Jade for June 17, 2015. \u00a0My fianc\u00e9 and I visited last year and LOVED it. \u00a0It's a great balance between intimate and spacious, and they reeeally seem to know their wedding stuff. \u00a0My parents also stayed there earlier in the year and loved it. \u00a0I think it would be a great choice!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Are you having a legal ceremony there or the symbolic. I looked in to the legal requirements and it seems like they require a lot of information. My understanding is that a lot of brides get married at a Justice of the Peace before heading to Mexico for the ceremony... am I curious how you are proceeding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mandiesueb@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"38.99.122.168","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388883717,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275879.jpg?_r=1431174019","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Mandiesue","Id":275879,"Name":"Mandiesue","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.156.209.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73727,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4668b493d178c24a22406c66409209e3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"rachelia160\" post=\"1823482\" timestamp=\"1389054100\"]\nHi everyone! I&#039;m also super excited to see other 2015 brides...I was feeling a little crazy for starting planning so far in advance, but I figure for a destination wedding people need to plan really far in advance.\n\nI just booked my ceremony at the Now Jade for June 17, 2015.  My fianc\u00e9 and I visited last year and LOVED it.  It&#039;s a great balance between intimate and spacious, and they reeeally seem to know their wedding stuff.  My parents also stayed there earlier in the year and loved it.  I think it would be a great choice![\/quote]\nOh my, you already booked for June?! We want ours on June 20th, and we have no idea what venue yet. I need to get hustling... don&#039;t want to have to pick another date :(","Attachments":[],"Id":1826301,"PostDate":1389816609,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>rachelia160, on 06 January 2014 - 04:21 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi everyone! I'm also super excited to see other 2015 brides...I was feeling a little crazy for starting planning so far in advance, but I figure for a destination wedding people need to plan really far in advance.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I just booked my ceremony at the Now Jade for June 17, 2015. \u00a0My fianc\u00e9 and I visited last year and LOVED it. \u00a0It's a great balance between intimate and spacious, and they reeeally seem to know their wedding stuff. \u00a0My parents also stayed there earlier in the year and loved it. \u00a0I think it would be a great choice!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Oh my, you already booked for June?! We want ours on June 20th, and we have no idea what venue yet. I need to get hustling... don't want to have to pick another date <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ruth.kendall@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.156.209.169","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389675775,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276066.jpg?_r=1389737991","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ruthehk","Id":276066,"Name":"ruthehk","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"73727","Title":"2015 bride just getting started!","LastPostDate":1422923370},"Pages":{"TotalItems":23,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
